(text "ePWM1A/1B AND GATE_EN (SN74LVC2G08) -> 33 ohm -> mezzanine; SN74LVC1G74 fault latch (D = 1, CLK = ARM, CLR_N = FAULT_LATCH_N, Q = FAULT_N = ARMED); 3 x SN74LV21A combiners; SN74LV04A restores the UVLO and PG_BIAS polarities (A-C6, A-C7); TLV1702 comparators with REF3125-derived thresholds." (at 12.7 22.86 0)
